  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "tag": "p",
   "class": "container max-width-1300 wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 262,
   "text": "Q: Are picture discs the same as color vinyl?\nNo. Picture discs are constructed differently, with an image layer inside the record. They almost always have more surface noise than standard or color vinyl and are typically bought for display as much as listening.",
